---
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CitationCard from '../../components/CitationCard.astro';
---
<article class="page-panel citation-page">
  <PageHeader class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Carrie Gabaree Digital Archive</p>
    <h1>Walter Mendygral Oral History - Side A</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Oral-history interview with Walter Mendygral about joining the Army Air Corps,
      military training, and his World War II service. Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)
      conducted the interview, with Josephine Mendygral also participating.
    </p>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="citation-summary audio-summary">
    <img
      class="oral-history-player-image"
      src="/media/walter-mendygral-army-1200x900.webp"
      alt="Walter Mendygral wearing military flight gear beside an aircraft"
      width="1200"
      height="900"
    />
    <audio class="oral-history-audio" controls preload="metadata">
      <source src="https://media.carriegabaree.com/oral-histories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-a.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
      Your browser does not support the audio player.
    </audio>
    <p class="oral-history-links audio-link">
      <a href="https://media.carriegabaree.com/oral-histories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-a.mp3">
        Download or open the MP3
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="citation-summary">
    <p class="publication-meta">
      Identifier: CORHC-0006 · Side A · Runtime: 47:53
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Interviewee:</strong> Walter Mendygral<br />
      <strong>Interviewer:</strong> Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)<br />
      <strong>Additional participant:</strong> Josephine Mendygral<br />
      <strong>Format:</strong> Streaming audio (MP3)<br />
      <strong>Language:</strong> English
    </p>
  </section>

  <CitationCard class="citation-card">
    <div class="citation-card-header"><h2>Transcript</h2></div>
    <p>A speaker-identified transcript is available for research, accessibility, and reference.</p>
    <div class="button-group">
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-a-transcript">
        Read transcript online
      </a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-a-transcript.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Download transcript (PDF)
      </a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/citations/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-a-citation">
        Cite oral history
      </a>
    </div>
  </CitationCard>

  <aside class="citation-note">
    <h2>Access note</h2>
    <p>
      This is Side A of the interview. <a href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-b">Listen to Side B</a>.
      The archive may later provide a combined streaming edition of both sides.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <aside class="citation-note">
    <h2>Transcript note</h2>
    <p>
      The transcript was generated using automated speech recognition and then reviewed.
      Speaker names, spelling, and selected wording have been corrected. Bracketed unclear
      passages mark audio that could not be transcribed confidently.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <div class="button-group citation-actions oral-history-back">
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="/oral-histories">Back to oral histories</a>
  </div>

  <p class="citation-disclaimer">
    This oral-history recording and transcript are provided for research, education,
    and public-history access. The audio recording remains the primary source.
  </p>
</article>
